/-!
# MTT: cusp forms, modular integrals, periods, and complex critical values

Definition: `MTT_Arithmetic` (`17c4c3ed-e06c-488a-aa8c-33deaf9fd03b`), by davidloeffler, 2026-09-05.

Analytic cusp forms with explicit nebentypus and normalized Hecke eigenform conditions; actual
modular integrals and inverse-character Mellin transforms; and signed algebraic period data with a
finitely generated integral lattice. Existence of this period system is a separate theorem target.
The signed projections include one half.

